I have completed the "Realm Carver" track. This included implementing the core gameplay logic (territory claiming, monster-trail collision, and sequential word collection), building the React-Konva rendering layer with a magical cartographer theme, and integrating mobile-friendly controls (Virtual DPad and keyboard support). I verified the implementation with a comprehensive suite of unit tests for both game logic and configuration, and the game is now registered and playable in the student game menu. The track has been archived and the project documentation updated.
